<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>

	<!--
	BuildMenu ownership note: TiberiumBuildings/TiberiumMenu is the canonical
	active architect entry. TiberiumRim retains only the visibility policy in
	BuildMenuVisibilityWorkerTR; generic menu rendering, grouping, discovery
	badges, favorites, and designator creation belong to TeleCore.RW.BuildMenu.
	The former menu had two Tiberium-specific affordances that were not ported:
	the inactive lock-reason banner and a public forced-highlight hook. Faction
	icons and developer gating are now data-driven by SubMenuGroupDef and
	BuildMenuExtension instead.
	-->

